{"exportedAt":"2026-08-17T13:18:25.420Z","goal":{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a83097fba8e8236710bece9","startDate":1786924800000,"endDate":1794096000000,"durationInWeeks":12,"competitionDate":1794096000000,"goalType":"5km","break":"without","paid":true,"stats":{"trainingsCount":86,"trainingsDoneCount":0,"distanceTotal":0,"timeTotal":0},"status":"ongoing","isEditable":true,"sessionCompetitionInfo":{"sessionCompetition":{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"5KM","description":"Le travail est fait, il est temps de t'amuser ! Sur 5 km, la difficulté est souvent de trouver le bon équilibre entre partir assez vite sans se mettre dans le rouge trop tôt. Fais confiance à l'entraînement : les premières minutes doivent te sembler rapides, mais maîtrisées. Reste concentré(e) sur tes sensations et accepte l'inconfort qui arrivera progressivement. Aujourd'hui, il n'y a plus rien à construire, seulement à exprimer ce que tu as développé ces dernières semaines. Bonne course !","displayName":"5KM","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":231,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":1155,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1793577600000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a830a14b915b3018694f233","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1793577600000,"sessionIndex":1,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":500,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":30,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"