ale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Vas-y mollo aujourd'hui car avec les belles séances de fractionné que tu fais en ce moment, il faut s'assurer de ne pas te fatiguer plus que de raison pour éviter les blessures !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"VMA_600_3","description":"**Séance VMA en deux blocs**. Le 45/45 c'est l'enchaînement de 45\" à ton allure VMA *(calculée par nos soins)* suivies de 45\" de footing lent. Sur le premier bloc tu enchaîneras 5 fois les 45\" rapides et 45\" lent puis tu prendras 4' *(soit 3'15 de bonus !)* pour repartir ensuite sur le second bloc identique.","displayName":"Vitesse Maximale Aérobie (VMA)","coachAdvice":"On avance petit à petit dans le cycle, les séances commencent à te mettre à l'épreuve. Moins tu seras crispé(e) dans l'effort, mieux ça se passera pour toi.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_0.75","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":212,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5"