,{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Qu'en est-il de l'amélioration de tes capacités cardio-respiratoires ? Tu devrais vraiment être très à l'aise à ton allure de footing arrivé(e) à ce stade de ta préparation ! Lorsqu'on est en forme, les footings, ce sont des entraînements où on a presque l'impression d'être aussi frais en revenant qu'avant d'être parti ! (et si tu es parti déjà fatigué(e) à cause de l'entraînement fractionné de la veille par exemple... alors tu ne devrais pas être plus fatigué(e) encore en rentrant sinon mieux vaut raccourcir le footing avant de rentrer dans cet état d'accumulation de fatigue supplémentaire!)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.038123167155425,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_4","description":"Séance de seuil 30' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"On commence à aborder les choses sérieuses. Reste concentré(e) pendant tes intervalles d'allures. Attention à ta posture, à ton gainage et à ton souffle afin de rester efficace. Avec la fatigue, tu vas vouloir te relâcher : grosse erreur.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":9.059168114453595,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_65_HARD_2","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries de 10' Tempo, séparées par 2' de repos.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"En continuité avec ce que tu as fait jusqu'à maintenant. On continue de désacraliser l'heure de couse à pied. Tu es d'ores et déjà capable de courir bien plus longtemps.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_30","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_10","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_11","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":11,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a830a14b915b3018694f228","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1789344000000,"sessionIndex":6,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liq