0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Footing en endurance fondamentale. L'impression en fin de séance doit être celle d'être plus en forme qu'avant de l'avoir commencée. On ne doit pas se fatiguer sur cette séance, juste enchaîner les kilomètres sans stress !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1792368000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.0588235294117645,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Affutage_5_600_S2_HARD2","description":"Séance d'allure 5km avec pré-fatigue à S30. L'entrainement se distingue en 2 blocs. Un premier bloc de 4 fois 3' à S30 suivies par 1'30 de footing lent. Un second bloc de 2 fois 4' à allure 5km suivies par 2' de recupération lente. Entre ces 2 blocs, prends au moins 2' de récupération supplémentaire.","displayName":"S30 + Allure 5km","coachAdvice":"Sur le papier la séance te paraîtra abordable, il n'y pas tant d'allure 5km que ça. Mais ne sous-estime pas la pré-fatigue ! Donc on en fait pas trop, on reste en contrôle malgré le cardio très élevé, et on reste efficace sur l'allure de course","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":240,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1.5.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":593,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":90,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":593,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A5_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"5km","value":231,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"5km"},"durations":[{"value":240,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":593,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t